{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_108_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_108","textTraditional":"一、十有二年，春王正月，盛伯來奔。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_108_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_108","textTraditional":"盛伯者何？失地之君也。何以不名？兄弟辭也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_108_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_108","textTraditional":"二、〈木巳〉伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_108_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_108","textTraditional":"三、二月庚子，子叔姬卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_108_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_108","textTraditional":"此未適人，何以卒？許嫁矣。婦人許嫁，字而笄之，死則以成人喪治之。其稱子何？貴也。其貴奈何？母弟也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_108_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_108","textTraditional":"四、夏，楚人圍巢。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_108_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_108","textTraditional":"五、秋，滕子來朝。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_108_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_108","textTraditional":"六、秦伯使遂來聘。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_108_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_108","textTraditional":"遂者何？秦大夫也。秦無大夫，此何以書？賢繆公也。何賢乎繆公？以為能變也。其為能變奈何？惟諓諓善竫言。俾君子易怠。而況乎我多有之，惟一介斷斷焉無他技。其心休休，能有容，是難也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_108_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_108","textTraditional":"七、冬，十有二月戊午，晉人、秦人戰于河曲。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_108_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_108","textTraditional":"此偏戰也，何以不言師敗績？敵也。曷為以水地？河曲疏矣，河千里而一曲也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_108_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_108","textTraditional":"八、季孫行父帥師城諸及運。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}